Package: nwstop
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, python3
Description: traffic monitor for VPN nodes
 nwstop captures packets on a network interface and shows, per remote
 IP address, the service name, port, current rates and totals, with
 scrolling, sorting, filtering and reverse DNS lookups.
 .
 It is meant for servers that relay client traffic, such as VPN or
 proxy nodes, and must be run as root.
